# A new preset's dialog going in steps (sf presenters.mbt panel_go): 添加目录, then 浏览文件夹…, then back twice by the
# system's back. MBUI_FIXTURE=newchat-preset-new, a phone's window (MBUI_FILM_PLATFORM=2).
timeout 20000
until 名字
wait 800
tap 添加目录
wait 900
tap 浏览文件夹…
wait 900
back
wait 900
back
wait 900
back
wait 900
exit
